<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1660_6051.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guettwillig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachpaurlich</unclear> dienst sambt was wir
<lb n="2"/>ehren, liebs und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetts</unclear> vermoegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuevor</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/>fromb, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuernemb</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtig</unclear>, ersam und weiß insonders
<lb n="4"/>liebe herren freuendt und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guette</unclear> nachpaurn,
<lb n="5"/>E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. F. E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. schriben wegen der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guldin</unclear> und groben
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">muentzsortten</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dieweil</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbige</unclear> innhalt der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daby</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eingeschloßnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verzeichnuß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerthin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuerts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genomen</unclear>,
<lb n="8"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hirin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verborgerte</unclear> vor dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßwegen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/>klagten verlust und schaden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verhuettet</unclear> werden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßgleich</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>was <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbigem</unclear> mehr anhangen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuett</unclear>. Haben wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ab</unclear>-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lesens</unclear> wol verstanden.
<lb n="12"/>Dieweil dan die sachen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hieeunder</unclear> also beschaffen, daß
<lb n="13"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnegefar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuevor</unclear> ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allgemeine</unclear> ord-
<lb n="14"/>nung wo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gantzen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">reich</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">doch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffs</unclear> wenigst
<lb n="15"/>in allen umbligenden stetten des <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Boden</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>seeischen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kreißes</unclear> gemacht wurde, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kein</unclear> preiß oder
<lb n="17"/>werth <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> die muentz setzen wolten. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mueßten</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>wir es diß fahls, auch fuer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dißmahl</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> der
<lb n="19"/>zeit dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bißhero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewohnlichen</unclear> valore verbleiben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>.
<lb n="20"/>So den herren wir zue <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerantwurtt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denen</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeneme</unclear> dienst und nachparlichen willen zue-
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erweißen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorderst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urpiettig</unclear>, hiemit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichtswiß</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>anfuegen wollen. Gottes <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnadt</unclear> mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> allen.
<lb n="24"/>Datum <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-36" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ratholffzell</unclear></origPlace> <origDate resp="#ner">den 3. novembris <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">a°</unclear> 609</origDate>.
<lb n="25"/>Buergermeister
<lb n="26"/>und rath <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daselbsten</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1660_6052.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1660_6053.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1660_6054.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="27"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromben</unclear> fuersichtigen ersamen unnd
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weysen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rate</unclear> der statt
<lb n="29"/>St. Gallen</orgName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear> guenstigen lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hern</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>gueten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freunden</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpaurn</unclear>.
</p>
